{"id":"7e060283e46d1355","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-theory-consistency-code.md","title":"理论码的一致性","display":"df-theory-consistency-code — 理论码的一致性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-theory-consistency-code","aliases":["58-df-theory-consistency-code"],"display":"df-theory-consistency-code — 理论码的一致性","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-free-for.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-theory-consistency-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-theory-consistency-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-consistency-code — 理论码的一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ad179c98b9a237c\" href=\"?note=8ad179c98b9a237c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-free-for.md\">../batch06/58-df-free-for.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md\">../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\pi,n,i,j,k,\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi,x,s,t,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(T,\\pi,n,i,j,k,\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi,x,s,t,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathsf F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathsf V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner\\)</span> 为同一公式语法的构造子，不是新的真值谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span> 是对象语言等号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span> 是代码的元语言相等。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner=\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner=\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner\\)</span>；其余派生联结词按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> 展开。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> 使用所列依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}^{H}_{58}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}^{H}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{bot}_{58}\">\\(\\mathsf{bot}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertLine}_{58,S}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertLine}_{58,S}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertDerivation}_{58,S}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertDerivation}_{58,S}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 由下式定义。理论参数要求为句子码集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}:=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathsf F:\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{bot}_{58}:=\\ulcorner\\neg\\forall v_0\\,(v_0\\doteq v_0)\\urcorner.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}:=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathsf F:\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{bot}_{58}:=\\ulcorner\\neg\\forall v_0\\,(v_0\\doteq v_0)\\urcorner.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ax}^{H}_{58}:={}&amp;\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\varphi)\\urcorner:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf F\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner(\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\chi))\\to((\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\chi))\\urcorner:\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathsf F\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner(\\neg\\varphi\\to\\neg\\psi)\\to(\\psi\\to\\varphi)\\urcorner:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf F\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi,t,x)\\urcorner:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf F,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\ \\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(t,x,\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\,\\psi)\\urcorner:\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf F,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner t\\doteq t\\urcorner:t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner(s\\doteq t)\\to(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi,s,x)\n\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi,t,x))\\urcorner:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf F,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V,\\ s,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{67mm}\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(s,x,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(t,x,\\varphi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ax}^{H}_{58}:={}&amp;\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\varphi)\\urcorner:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf F\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner(\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\chi))\\to((\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\chi))\\urcorner:\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathsf F\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner(\\neg\\varphi\\to\\neg\\psi)\\to(\\psi\\to\\varphi)\\urcorner:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf F\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi,t,x)\\urcorner:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf F,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\ \\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(t,x,\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\,\\psi)\\urcorner:\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf F,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner t\\doteq t\\urcorner:t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\ulcorner(s\\doteq t)\\to(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi,s,x)\n\\to\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi,t,x))\\urcorner:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathsf F,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V,\\ s,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{67mm}\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(s,x,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(t,x,\\varphi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HilbertLine}_{58,S}(\\pi,i,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\pi\\in\\mathsf F^n\\land i\\in n\\land\\bigl[\n\\pi(i)\\in T\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}^{H}_{58}\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j,k\\in i\\;\\bigl(\\pi(k)=\\ulcorner\\pi(j)\\to\\pi(i)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j\\in i\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathsf V\\;\\bigl(\\pi(i)=\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\pi(j)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HilbertDerivation}_{58,S}(\\pi,T,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\land\\theta\\in\\mathsf F\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\pi\\in\\mathsf F^{n+1}\\land\\pi(n)=\\theta\n\\land\\forall i\\in n+1\\;\\mathrm{HilbertLine}_{58,S}(\\pi,i,T)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HilbertDerivation}_{58,S}(\\pi,T,\\mathsf{bot}_{58}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HilbertLine}_{58,S}(\\pi,i,T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\pi\\in\\mathsf F^n\\land i\\in n\\land\\bigl[\n\\pi(i)\\in T\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}^{H}_{58}\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j,k\\in i\\;\\bigl(\\pi(k)=\\ulcorner\\pi(j)\\to\\pi(i)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j\\in i\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathsf V\\;\\bigl(\\pi(i)=\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\pi(j)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HilbertDerivation}_{58,S}(\\pi,T,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\land\\theta\\in\\mathsf F\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\pi\\in\\mathsf F^{n+1}\\land\\pi(n)=\\theta\n\\land\\forall i\\in n+1\\;\\mathrm{HilbertLine}_{58,S}(\\pi,i,T)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HilbertDerivation}_{58,S}(\\pi,T,\\mathsf{bot}_{58}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad T+\\sigma:=T\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad T+\\sigma:=T\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明系统固定为上述有限推导规则及具体逻辑公理实例；未把任意外加“证明关系”当作一致性定义。</li>\n<li>理论只有闭句，故全称推广不需要额外检查未解除假设的自由变元。等词替换使用对象语言等号，不把两个项码是否相等误作逻辑公理的前件。</li>\n<li>元数学断言与其算术化可再区分；这里保留调用方的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 名称，直接给出其有限证明含义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","statu